        "created_at": "2018-10-24T00:36:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just wanted to confirm whether this was incorrect behaviour or not.</p>\n<p>Cards underneath Concepts are still Hero cards, right? &nbsp;When using a Concept power, the first card destroyed is not taken by Kinetic Looter in the digital version (later in the turn,&nbsp;a card destroyed by Giant Floaty Head is taken by Looter).</p>\n<p>Thanks,</p>",
